# CRITICAL: The issue is likely one of these:
# 1. Environment variables not saved properly in Render
# 2. Variable names have extra spaces or characters  
# 3. Render build cache needs to be cleared
# 4. The tokens might have expired

# TROUBLESHOOTING STEPS:
# 1. In Render Dashboard -> Environment tab
# 2. Delete ALL existing environment variables
# 3. Add them ONE BY ONE using the exact names below:
#    BOT_TOKEN (paste the value after =)
#    METAAPI_TOKEN (paste the long JWT token)
#    MONGODB_URI (paste the MongoDB connection string)  
#    NODE_ENV (set to: production)
# 4. Click "Deploy Latest Commit" to rebuild with clean cache